# Legacy Fix – Solution Report

**Project:** Djehuty

**Problem:** I found that the notification messages are not working properly.

**Cause:** In `edit-session.html`, the error message is added again whenever the user clicks Save without entering a token name.
 That's why the same message appears multiple times. In `landing_page.js`, the timer directly clears the message,
 which can remove another notification. Also, the success message is missing its text.

**Solution:** I would use the existing `show_message()` function instead of directly changing the `#message` element. 
This function clears the previous timer, replaces the old message, applies the correct colour and hides the message automatically
after 20 seconds. I would also check the timer and add the missing success message in `landing_page.js`.

**Expected Result:** The error message should not repeat, new notifications should replace old ones, the correct colour should appear,
 and each message should disappear at the correct time.

**Status:** I inspected the code and identified the problem and its solution. I have not changed or tested the code yet.